  message: "Fixed in PR #2318. The item's repro re-run on dev: a file with 'from flask import Flask; app = Flask(__name__)' now emits kind=hosted_application, label 'Flask application', target python:app/__init__.py:6-6:app:variable; no main_function entry on a variable. The strict xfail test_a_flask_application_is_not_a_main_function is a plain passing test. The 'application' concept now maps to hosted_application; the 7 program starts by construction (IOApp, ZIOApp, SwiftUI App, app delegates) moved to concept 'entrypoint' and stay main_function on a class target, which is WI-rifad. Evidence file: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr7/live_repro/dev_after_merge.txt (dev 9d1ebb229, 2026-11-22)."  # 5e54
